{"4072920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "True Nightmare - Diner Loop", "steam_appid": 4072920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4964870], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FIRST CASE MAY BECOME THE LAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claire is a young FBI agent assigned to her very first field case. Alongside her senior partner, she is sent to investigate a mysterious series of murders that began in a remote region some time ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/c00127076df985bc9d1c3d9b05d6955d.poster.avif?t=1786271776\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/c00127076df985bc9d1c3d9b05d6955d.webm?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/c00127076df985bc9d1c3d9b05d6955d.mp4?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>second episode</strong> of the True Nightmare series—psychological horror stories that feel disturbingly real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped in a looping anomaly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the rules of the anomaly, advance further and further, bypassing altered rooms and deadly dangers that await inside. The further you go, the more distorted the environment becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2394b2c00415bffc653a3600a8c68f58.poster.avif?t=1786271776\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2394b2c00415bffc653a3600a8c68f58.webm?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2394b2c00415bffc653a3600a8c68f58.mp4?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The unique experience of special rooms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rooms contain more than just anomalies; they embody the fears of those who have already fallen into this place - these are unique encounters and events that send shivers down your spine and fill you with bone-deep dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2fe081b9f93b9f2de89e50b2643e7020.poster.avif?t=1786271776\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2fe081b9f93b9f2de89e50b2643e7020.webm?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2fe081b9f93b9f2de89e50b2643e7020.mp4?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It follows</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistakes are not fatal, but something that haunts you is approaching. And when it finds you... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Psychological Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro VHS Aesthetic [effect can be reduced or disabled]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looping anomaly with unique encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FIRST CASE MAY BECOME THE LAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claire is a young FBI agent assigned to her very first field case. Alongside her senior partner, she is sent to investigate a mysterious series of murders that began in a remote region some time ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/c00127076df985bc9d1c3d9b05d6955d.poster.avif?t=1786271776\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/c00127076df985bc9d1c3d9b05d6955d.webm?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/c00127076df985bc9d1c3d9b05d6955d.mp4?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>second episode</strong> of the True Nightmare series—psychological horror stories that feel disturbingly real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped in a looping anomaly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the rules of the anomaly, advance further and further, bypassing altered rooms and deadly dangers that await inside. The further you go, the more distorted the environment becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2394b2c00415bffc653a3600a8c68f58.poster.avif?t=1786271776\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2394b2c00415bffc653a3600a8c68f58.webm?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072920/extras/2394b2c00415bffc653a3600a8c68f58.mp4?t=1786271776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The unique experience of special rooms</h2><p clas